# Temporal files. ONE folder for throwaway work: sandbox verification snippets,
# one-off test scripts, battery runs. Nothing that must be consulted belongs
# here -- it is swept (Heartbeat._fire, Sandbox.run_python, tools/temp_clean.py)
# once a file is older than the TTL.
#
# This replaces the old behaviour, where a verification wrote a fresh uniquely-
# named `_verify_*.py` into the repo ROOT -- `Sandbox._resolve` anchors a bare
# relative name at the project root -- and nothing ever removed it: 4,905 of them
# accumulated and rode into the repo on the next `git add -A`. The `_verify_*`
# and `_battery_*` patterns are kept as a belt for anything that regresses.
_tmp/
_verify_*.py
_battery_*.py
_sandbox_run.py

# Local working paper
PAPER.md

# Derived neural state. Regenerable from books/ via tools/population.py, and far
# too large for git: san.npy is 268 MB and cortex.npz 61 MB for one individual.
# Lineages are kept on disk under state/lineage/ instead, where a lived individual
# can be restored without a clone.
# These were anchored at one level, so state/reader/state/language_state.san.npy --
# 268 MB, nested two deep -- matched nothing and `git add -A state/` swept 421 MB of
# binaries into a commit. A glob with a single * does not mean "under here", it
# means "exactly here", and the reader keeps its own full copy of the state.
state/*.san.npy
state/*.cortex.npz
state/*.cortex.meta.json
state/*.cortex.facts.json
state/*.seq.npz
state/*.seq.slots.json
state/**/*.san.npy
state/**/*.cortex.npz
state/**/*.cortex.meta.json
state/**/*.cortex.facts.json
state/**/*.seq.npz
state/**/*.seq.slots.json
state/**/*.npy
state/**/*.npz
state/**/*.sqlite3
state/reader/state/
state/lineage/
state/population/
state/merged/

# Public-domain books fetched by tools/make_library.py. Tens of megabytes of
# somebody else's prose, reproducible exactly from a URL and a script.
books/gutenberg_*.txt

# Runtime artefacts: lineages, pooled individuals, fitness snapshots, reading
# shelves. All regenerable from the corpus, the tools and the clock.
state/merged*/
state/reading/
state/shelf/
state/fitness/
state/population/
state/reader.log
state/lineage/
state/drill_store.json
